آن الأوان","https://www.poetsgate.com/ViewPoem.aspx?id=215685",""],[4861,"من القلب","https://www.poetsgate.com/ViewPoem.aspx?id=33707",""],[4875,"دهاليز الغياب","https://www.poetsgate.com/ViewPoem.aspx?id=133355",""],[4901,"قد بدا ما يسر فيما تقول","https://www.poetsgate.com/ViewPoem.aspx?id=186127",""],[4930,"مراعي البؤس","https://www.poetsgate.com/ViewPoem.aspx?id=213102",""],[5055,"هيف الثمار","https://www.poetsgate.com/ViewPoem.aspx?id=177434",""],[5106,"زَاْكِيَاْتٍ كَفَرْحَةِ الأَنْبِيَ","https://www.poetsgate.com/ViewPoem.aspx?id=156840",""],[5232,"سهرة مع الأخطل الصغير","https://www.poetsgate.com/ViewPoem.aspx?id=212497",""],[5295,"أنين","https://www.poetsgate.com/ViewPoem.aspx?id=171625",""],[1824,"أيها الأوحد الفريد سلام","https://www.poetsgate.com/ViewPoem.aspx?id=170048",""],[5376,"نشيد الاقصى","https://www.poetsgate.com/ViewPoem.aspx?id=190447",""],[5401,"مجنون ليلى","https://www.poetsgate.com/ViewPoem.aspx?id=78116",""],[5533,"لم يَكُنْ قَلْبِي مَعِي","https://www.poetsgate.com/ViewPoem.aspx?id=179939",""],[5596,"من وحي \"بون\"","https://www.poetsgate.com/ViewPoem.aspx?id=206482",""],[5596,"رد على قصيدة حمزة بن عبد الحميد","https://www.poetsgate.com/ViewPoem.aspx?id=206717",""],[5725,"هاك قلبي","https://www.poetsgate.com/ViewPoem.aspx?id=177424",""],[5732,"ملحمه عكاظ","https://www.poetsgate.com/ViewPoem.aspx?id=177864",""],[5818,"حمامات الحرم","https://www.poetsgate.com/ViewPoem.aspx?id=177754",""],[5829,"حمص العدية","https://www.poetsgate.com/ViewPoem.aspx?id=158855",""],[5948,"يا حَمَويه اسمع ثَناء صادقاً","https://www.poetsgate.com/ViewPoem.aspx?id=100581",""],[5969,"الشَبَحْ","https://www.poetsgate.com/ViewPoem.aspx?id=198818",""],[6008,"الحب بلوى","https://www.poetsgate.com/ViewPoem.aspx?id=60800",""],[6031,"يا خَليليَّ مِنْ ذُؤابَةَ شيبان","https://www.poetsgate.com/ViewPoem.aspx?id=46346",""],[6056,"الموااادع","https://www.poetsgate.com/ViewPoem.aspx?id=156209",""],[6082,"بوح انثى","https://www.poetsgate.com/ViewPoem.aspx?id=60186",""],[6261,"ال